+- `TestAdminPaginationBoundary` now counts rows (`<tr>`) and asserts the full
+  50-label set 1..50 before the 51st, then page 1 = 51..2 (50 rows, no 1) and
+  page 2 = exactly 1 row (light 1), plus the same for the rows fragment.
+- `TestAdminWalkPage` parses the hidden `csrf_token` value and compares it to
+  the `csrf_token` cookie exactly (previously only presence was checked).
+- `TestAdminCreateOutsideBBox` asserts the no-JS re-render keeps label, asset
+  number, kind, lat, lon, accuracy and the town bbox, and emits a non-empty
