+  default `park` kind (so the returned page is a retryable form).
+- `TestAdminEdit` captures the photo URL before a label-only edit and asserts
+  both longitude (`-71.029000`) and the unchanged photo afterwards.
+
+### 3. Server fixes behind those tests
+
+- `walkPageDataOf` now echoes `AssetNo` (was dropped on every 422/409 re-render).
+- `walkReject`'s parse-error path (no parsed submission) now renders a real
+  form: fresh CSRF token, town bbox and default `park` kind instead of an empty
+  token/bbox.
+
+### 4. `pages/admin-login.html` is now the LIVE login page (reviewer-alt 6)
+
+`auth.go` is frozen for this task and renders `loginPageTmpl` with nil data, so
+`installLoginPage()` (called from this task's `init()` in `admin.go`) renders
+`pages/admin-login.html` through the existing pipeline once at startup and
+installs the output as `loginPageTmpl`. The frozen strings are unchanged; the
+served page is now the styled pico card from the pipeline (base.html + template),
+not auth.go's unstyled inline markup. `TestAdminLoginPageIsTheStyledPipelinePage`
+drives `GET /admin/login` through the handler and asserts the pico stylesheet,
+`id="admin-login"`, the three frozen strings and a complete document.
+
+## Routes (all `AdminOnly`, registered from this task's own `init()`s)
+
+| Route | Behaviour |
